    "decisive_moment": "The Ridder transaction restructured the family newspaper and gave him majority voting control.",
    "enduring_dimensions": [
      "Commissioned Robert Reamer to design a headquarters combining offices and printing operations.",
      "Held the publishing position from 1915 until his death in 1941."
